--        dies or leaves stays unled and panics for 2 days. Schools and pods need a wet leader; `place` makes one led group;
--        DF's seeded schools are led. Animal people in the caverns come at most 5 a group, lifted during an irruption.
--        `groups adopt|layers|clock|cavern|panic|natives|apcap`.
--        Ecology (R8 R33 R37 R38 R40 R41 R43 R47 R58 R62): cadence 3,000 and nudge off by default (a pre-7.1 config migrates
--        once). Predator skill profiles on DF's 0-20 scale (solitary apex 15, other solitary 12, pack SNEAK 5 and combat 10,
--        +SNEAK 10 at the pack share), written to the caste and the soul with the rust floor, and read back. Packs are
--        recognised from tracked groups or hunters standing together. Raptors are armed, take prey up to twice their mass,
