--        edge, the run season); polar bears swim to the fish. MODEL.swimScavenger and MODEL.cohesionOf (the whole-list
--        solitary/pack/herd/flock/school table, with overrides). `hunters ...`.
--        Scavenging and curious beasts (R16 R17 R18 R30 R42): a natural cadence -- remains found after hours (by size and
--        distance), only within a scavenger's perception, walked to under budgets, one hop only after no progress, eaten
